  "conventions": {
    "units": "metres, kilograms, seconds, radians; right handed",
    "book_up": "+Z",
    "engine_up": "+Y",
    "basis": "R(x,y,z)=(x,z,-y), proper Rx(-pi/2), determinant +1",
    "quaternions": "stored w,x,y,z; active local-to-world Hamilton rotation",
    "local_coordinates": "COM-relative body coordinates and shape vertices undergo R. The abstract joint coordinate labels X/U/V are retained, NOT also basis-converted: localFrame_engine=r*localFrame_book; body orientation_engine=r*q_book*inverse(r). Thus world primary/U/V are exactly R times the named book vectors.",
    "orientation": "q_engine=r*q_book*inverse(r)",
    "literal_limb_half_turn": 1.5707499980926514,
    "rounding": "Preserve binary32 book literal 3.1415f/2. JSON derived values binary64; production conversion to binary32 once, normalize quaternions. Transcription parity <=1e-6 per coordinate/quaternion component up to sign.",
    "frames": "World frame columns [axis,u,v]; u=normalize(+Z cross axis), v=axis cross u in book coordinates. This is the pinned Math::GetOrtho convention for these +/-Y axes. Limits symmetric on equal U/V axes.",
    "rest_equivalence": "F_A=q_A0^-1*F_world; F_B=q_B0^-1*F_world. Current joint relative rotation is F_A^-1*(q_A^-1*q_B)*F_B. With q0=q_A0^-1*q_B0 and q_A0=identity here, this is F_world^-1*((q_A^-1*q_B)*q0^-1)*F_world. Conjugation preserves dot-product angular constraints; current admitted Hinge/CV providers are reused, never replaced with motors.",
    "parenting": "Logical mapping only; six physics entities remain world-space roots, not doubly Scene-parented."
  },
